<title>MEXICO: Telmex to report Q1 results later in day.</title>
<headline>Telmex to report Q1 results later in day.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telephone giant Telefonos de Mexico SA (Telmex) said on Thursday it would report its first quarter results later in the day.</p>
<p>Telmex will hold a meeting with analysts at 5:30 p.m. local (6:30 p.m. EDT/22:30 GMT) to discuss its quarterly result, according to a statement by the company.</p>
<p>((--David Luhnow, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
